  evidence: 'Original campaign design; not an extracted commercial level. Supplied
    recording: six-box tutorial at 00:00, 28-box diamond / four-slot fog puzzle at
    02:00, and queue pressure at 02:32. Layout family: Twin Loops. Deterministic
    full-footprint departure witness; exact per-color capacity balance. Difficulty
    changes arrow dependencies, board silhouettes, color count and delayed completion
    of mixed-color wool batches. All levels start with four slots and the same base
    speed. Hard levels are every multiple of five as requested. YouTube discovery
    links are documented separately; unwatched footage is not claimed as layout evidence.'
